  "eacl.secure-format-test/encrypted-cursors-accept-only-their-issued-spelling-test (CLJ and CLJS)"
  "eacl.secure-format-test/decode-canonical-admits-only-the-canonical-spelling-test (CLJ and CLJS)"
  "eacl.secure-format-test/base64url-decoding-admits-only-the-canonical-spelling-test (CLJ and CLJS)"]}
